{
  "_notes": [
    "Externalised mapping for Ventura NRI Account Opening booklet v28.",
    "Loaded by KycFormMappingLoader; consumed by KycFormFieldExpander.",
    "Validated on startup against field-inventory.json — typos fail fast, gaps are logged.",
    "",
    "Structure:",
    "  direct      — DTO getter name -> single PDF widget (read via BeanWrapper.getPropertyValue).",
    "  multiDirect — DTO getter name -> list of PDF widgets (same value fanned out).",
    "  dateSplits  — DTO getter (dd-MM-yyyy string) -> list of [day,month,year] widget triplets.",
    "  charSplits  — DTO getter -> list of {prefix,count}; value split one char per widget.",
    "  constants   — PDF widget -> constant value (always set, regardless of DTO).",
    "",
    "Complex logic (checkbox-set expansion, POI/POA inference, NRI overrides) stays in Java."
  ],

